at a text-to-image model can parse cleanly. Group subjects with their own attributes and actions. Use grounded phrasing for poses, interactions, and spatial layout.\n3. **Style Planning Stays Internal:** Use your internal reasoning to choose style, medium, framing, and lighting. Do not emit planning tags or wrappers in the visible answer body.\n4. **Text Rendering:** If the user requests visible text, quotes, labels, or typography, specify the exact text clearly and wrap requested words in quotes.\n5. **Avoid Over-Specification:** Do not invent highly specific clothing, colors, materials, or scene details unless the input supports them.\n6. **Structure:** Write one cohesive paragraph after the thinking block. No bullets, JSON, or markdown.\n7. **Respect Existing Detail:** If the user's prompt is already detailed, lightly polish and finalize rather than heavily expanding — preserve their phrasing and direction.\n8. **Respect the Human Form:** Treat depictions of people with dignity. Assume clothing covers genitals and intimate anatomy.\n9. **Preserve User Medium:** When the user explicitly requests a medium (e.g. \"photo of\", \"photograph of\", \"illustration of\", \"painting of\", \"sketch of\", \"3D render of\"), honor it. Do not pivot to a different medium to avoid difficulty — match the user's stated intent.\n10. **Ethereal Shimmering Light Prefix:** Always begin the expanded prompt with the exact phrase \"ethereal shimmering light style\", followed by a comma and a space before the rest of the prompt. This prefix must be the very first text in the output, regardless of any medium the user may have specified.\n\nUser's Input:"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "value"}, "name": "value", "label": "value", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "value"}], "flags": {}, "id": 62, "type": "PrimitiveStringMultiline", "title": "Text String (System Prompt)", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.25.0", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "PrimitiveStringMultiline"}, "order": 3}, {"outputs": [{"name": "STRING", "links": [147], "label": "STRING", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "STRING"}], "color": "#322", "widgets_values": ["妩媚女人侧卧在白色床单上，身穿一件超薄透的米色大号针织衫，一侧肩膀完全滑落露出锁骨，双腿蜷缩若隐若现，清晨强烈逆光透过百叶窗，在脊椎沟和髋骨上投射出条纹阴影，凌乱睡发，直视镜头带有侵略性的慵懒眼神，暖金色调，私密卧室氛围，浅景深，皮肤绒毛与毛孔清晰可见，腋下和膝盖窝的细微褶皱，高级情色艺术，暧昧昏黄。\n"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "value"}, "name": "value", "label": "value", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "value"}], "flags": {}, "type": "PrimitiveStringMultiline", "title": "Text String (User Prompt)", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#533", "size": [561.6227416992188, 341.3462219238281], "pos": [-1632.5679931640625, 269.7877502441406], "id": 63, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.25.0", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "PrimitiveStringMultiline"}, "order": 4}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "INT", "links": [135], "label": "INT", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "INT"}], "size": [270, 58], "pos": [-1632.5679931640625, 751.409912109375], "widgets_values": [1472], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "value"}, "name": "value", "label": "value", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "value"}], "flags": {}, "id": 85, "type": "JWInteger", "title": "宽度", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "JWInteger"}, "order": 5}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "INT", "links": [136], "label": "INT", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "INT"}], "size": [270, 58], "pos": [-1632.5679931640625, 874.4278564453125], "widgets_values": [1136], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "value"}, "name": "value", "label": "value", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "value"}], "flags": {}, "id": 86, "type": "JWInteger", "title": "高度", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "JWInteger"}, "order": 6}], "extra": {"VHS_KeepIntermediate": true, "links_added_by_ue": [], "KKvideo_latentpreview": false, "VHS_MetadataImage": true, "ue_links": [], "KKvideo_latentpreviewrate": 0, "0246.VERSION": [0, 0, 4], "VHS_lat